<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QUF half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QUF half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.35 vs 9.70</p>
<p>    Net					9.01 vs 8.68</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	    7.5 vs 7.5</p>
<p>NOTE: QUF Industries Ltd is a dairy group.</p>
<p>    Sales				  311.35 vs 296.19</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.84 vs 4.99</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    11.4 vs 11.2</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 26  </p>
<p>Reg date March 7</p>
<p>    Tax					4.82 vs 3.29</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs gain 2.79</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.85 vs 3.85</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   9.60 vs 9.12</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 3973-1800</p>
</text>
